hi i'm alicia and today i'm super  excited to talk about apogee x  which is the latest release of google  cloud's apigee api management platform  businesses have been executing on  digital transformation strategies for  many years  however the covid19 outbreak drastically  changed consumer behavior and work  environments  forcing businesses to quickly adapt and  accelerate their efforts to meet new  digital demands  such as delivering a connected seamless  digital experience  automating as many manual processes as  possible  operating anywhere with distributed  remote workforce  and unlocking new revenue streams  in order to meet these new demands  organizations should really think beyond  digital transformation  and strive to achieve digital excellence  apis are key to driving digital  excellence they enable companies to  deliver seamless experiences  modernize applications abstract the  complexity of legacy systems  and unlock new revenue streams as  enterprises rapidly scale and globalize  their digital transformation programs  their underlying api programs follow  correspondingly  therefore businesses need a very  comprehensive and powerful api  management platform  to support the new digital needs  apigee x helps businesses accelerate and  globalize their api programs to achieve  digital excellence it allows them to  deliver secure  high-performing reliable apis across the  globe with an integrated approach to  artificial intelligence  web application firewall identity  management  content delivery network and other  advanced cloud capabilities  let's take a closer look apogee x comes  with out of the box integration with  cloud cdn  which leverages the same network that  google uses to host its apps  used by billions of users this allows  you to deploy  and deliver high-performing apis across  24 regions  and 73 zones with caching across 93  points of presence  it provides multiple layers of security  for your apis  eliminating the need to integrate with  third-party solutions for web  application firewall and identity  management needs  apigee x is powered by google cloud's  industry leading ai  you can now apply machine intelligence  to automate trivial tasks related to api  operations and api security  so that you can really focus on business  critical activities  last but not least it provides the  flexibility to store data in the region  of your choice  gives you more control on encrypted data  and ensures that your business adheres  to all regulatory and compliance  requirements  let's see a quick demo of how this works  apogee x provides self-service  capabilities to create your own orgs and  environments to create an org simply  click  edit select the analytics hosting region  and enter the encryption key  after configuring the network and  runtime parameters  you can now create an environment by  providing the required details  for the purpose of this demo i created a  hello world proxy  added a few developers and registered to  front end app  if i try to access the proxy without a  key it fails  to further protect this proxy with cloud  armor you can create a new rule  or apply an existing rule to the api  proxy  when i try to access the same proxy  again without a key  you'll see a change in the error message  generated by cloud armor  now let's see how to apply cloud cdn  capabilities to your apis for enhanced  caching and performance  i created a very simple cdn policy and  applied it to the load balancer  in addition i added cache control so  that cloud cdn knows to cache the  responses  when i access the proxy from us west the  call is executed in about 10  milliseconds  if i take the same call and execute it  from a vm located in europe west  the response time for the first attempt  is about 215 milliseconds  [Music]  however because of the enhanced caching  the response time for the second attempt  goes down to 16 milliseconds  this was just a quick preview of apigee  x  in summary apigee x allows you to  deliver secure  high-performing reliable apis across the  globe with an integrated approach to  artificial intelligence  web application firewall identity  management  content delivery network and other  advanced cloud capabilities  now it's your turn to try it out and get  started by following the links in the  description below
 

